        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Target Pay Adjustments and Compensation Philosophy</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background-color: #ffffff;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n\n  .page-container {\n    max-width: 820px;\n    margin: 40px auto;\n    padding: 0 40px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  /* Two Column Section */\n  .top-section {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;\n    column-gap: 36px;\n    margin-bottom: 36px;\n  }\n\n  h2 {\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #000000;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n  }\n\n  .section-group {\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n\n  ul.bullet-list {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 18px;\n    list-style-type: disc;\n  }\n\n  ul.bullet-list li {\n    margin-bottom: 11px;\n    padding-left: 2px;\n  }\n\n  ul.bullet-list li:last-child {\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n\n  .highlight-green {\n    color: #72a926;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  /* Right column grid for achievements */\n  .achievement-table {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 22px;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .achievement-row {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 36px 1fr;\n    align-items: center;\n    column-gap: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .achievement-condition {\n    color: #72a926;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n\n  .achievement-arrow {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .achievement-arrow svg {\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 18px;\n    fill: #72a926;\n  }\n\n  .achievement-result {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    color: #333333;\n  }\n\n  /* Bottom Section */\n  .bottom-section {\n    border-top: none;\n  }\n\n  .section-title-green {\n    color: #72a926;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 10px 0;\n  }\n\n  .body-paragraph {\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n    color: #222222;\n    text-align: justify;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n  }\n\n  ul.philosophy-list {\n    margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n    padding-left: 32px;\n    list-style-type: disc;\n  }\n\n  ul.philosophy-list li {\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n\n  .list-lead-bold {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #000000;\n  }\n\n  .page-number {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #333333;\n    margin-top: 60px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page-container\">\n\n  <!-- Top Two-Column Area -->\n  <div class=\"top-section\">\n    <!-- Left Column -->\n    <div class=\"left-col\">\n      <div class=\"section-group\">\n        <h2>Target Pay Adjustments</h2>\n        <ul class=\"bullet-list\">\n          <li>Increase in proportion of \"at-risk\" target pay to <span class=\"highlight-green\">96%</span> of CEO target pay and <span class=\"highlight-green\">90%</span> of other NEO target pay</li>\n          <li>Increased CEO target variable cash to 200% of base salary (representing 50th percentile of peers)</li>\n          <li>No changes to NEOs (other than our CEO) base salary or target variable cash for the fourth consecutive year</li>\n          <li>Increase CEO target equity by 33%, increase weighting of MY PSUs to 50% of CEO's total target equity</li>\n          <li>Increase NEOs (other than our CEO) target equity by 39%</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"section-group\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">\n        <h2>Increased Performance Goals</h2>\n        <ul class=\"bullet-list\">\n          <li>Fiscal 2022 revenue and Non-GAAP Operating Income Threshold goals set above Fiscal 2021 performance</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Right Column -->\n    <div class=\"right-col\">\n      <h2>Performance Achievement; Maximum Payouts</h2>\n      <div class=\"achievement-table\">\n        <!-- Row 1 -->\n        <div class=\"achievement-row\">\n          <div class=\"achievement-condition\">\n            Revenue exceeded Stretch Operating Plan goal\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"achievement-arrow\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 18\">\n              <polygon points=\"0,5 15,5 15,0 28,9 15,18 15,13 0,13\" />\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"achievement-result\">\n            Variable cash payout at <span class=\"highlight-green\">200%</span> of target\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 2 -->\n        <div class=\"achievement-row\">\n          <div class=\"achievement-condition\">\n            Non-GAAP Operating Income exceeded Stretch Operating Plan goal\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"achievement-arrow\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 18\">\n              <polygon points=\"0,5 15,5 15,0 28,9 15,18 15,13 0,13\" />\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"achievement-result\">\n            <span class=\"highlight-green\">200% (150% for CEO)</span> of target SY PSU shares eligible to vest\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Row 3 -->\n        <div class=\"achievement-row\">\n          <div class=\"achievement-condition\">\n            3-year relative TSR exceeded Stretch goal\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"achievement-arrow\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 28 18\">\n              <polygon points=\"0,5 15,5 15,0 28,9 15,18 15,13 0,13\" />\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"achievement-result\">\n            <span class=\"highlight-green\">200% (150% for CEO)</span> of target MY PSU shares eligible to vest\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Bottom Full-Width Area -->\n  <div class=\"bottom-section\">\n    <div class=\"section-title-green\">Our Compensation Philosophy and Practices</div>\n    \n    <p class=\"body-paragraph\">\n      NVIDIA is building a one-of-a-kind company that invents the future, builds amazing technologies, and strives to achieve the highest level of craft. To achieve this vision, we must attract and retain a high-caliber executive team while balancing our stockholders' interests. While our CC considers numerous factors in making executive pay decisions, our compensation program is guided by the following goals and philosophies:\n    </p>\n\n    <ul class=\"philosophy-list\">\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"list-lead-bold\">Pay for Performance:</span> emphasize at-risk and performance-based cash and equity for NEOs based on multiple corporate metrics\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"list-lead-bold\">Provide Competitive Pay:</span> NEO target compensation should be competitive with our peers; reflects job impact, scope, and responsibilities; and is structured to attract and retain talent\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"list-lead-bold\">Stockholder Alignment:</span> structure NEO pay to align with stockholders' long-term interests and adjust in response to feedback received through our annual stockholder engagement and our annual \"say-on-pay\" vote\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <span class=\"list-lead-bold\">Simplicity and Transparency:</span> utilize clear, simple performance metrics that are defined and reported publicly\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <p class=\"body-paragraph\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">\n      Our executive compensation program adheres to the following practices:\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Page Number -->\n  <div class=\"page-number\">\n    40\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
